      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Your journey begins near Farming Village.



    For your first trade,
    enter the village and buy <b>Vegetables</b>.

    Take them to <b>Forest Village</b>,
    where they are needed, and sell them for a profit.



    From there, you have
    a choice:

    -> Buy <b>Meat</b> in Forest Village and bring it back to <b>Farming
    Village</b>.

    -> Carry the <b>Meat</b> onward to <b>Mountain Village</b>,
    then buy <b>Salt</b> there and bring it back to <b>Farming Village</b>.



    Follow
    the road signs, manage your supplies, and use the (?) <b>Help</b> button to see
    what each settlement produces and needs.



    Buy. Travel. Sell. Profit.



    Your
    first trade awaits.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
